{"v":1,"built_at":"2026-10-31T14:09:27.635Z","core":{"appSha":"016e493d7ff1","builtAt":"2026-10-31T14:07:58.019Z","schemaV":1},"key":"us/119-hr-3620","model":{"found":true,"billKey":"us/119-hr-3620","polity":"us","eyebrow":"United States","reference":"H.R. 3620","title":"Southcentral Foundation Land Transfer Act of 2025","titleExpandable":false,"meta":"Indian Affairs Committee, Energy and Commerce Committee, Natural Resources Committee · Rep. Nicholas Begich (R-AK)","summary":{"lead":"Official summary (Congressional Research Service, Reported to House): ","blocks":[{"kind":"para","text":"Southcentral Foundation Land Transfer Act of 2025","gap":"none"},{"kind":"para","text":"This bill directs the Department of Health and Human Services (HHS) to convey approximately 3.4 acres in Anchorage, Alaska, to the Southcentral Foundation (SCF) for use in connection with health and social services programs.","gap":"para"},{"kind":"para","text":"The conveyance must be made by warranty deed. The conveyance may not (1) require any consideration (such as payment) from the SCF for the property; (2) impose any obligation, term, or condition on the SCF relating to that property; or (3) allow for any U.S. reversionary interest in the property.","gap":"para"},{"kind":"para","text":"HHS must be accorded any easement or access to the property as may be reasonably necessary to satisfy any retained obligation or liability of HHS.","gap":"para"},{"kind":"para","text":"The bill prohibits the SCF from being liable for certain environmental contamination that occurred on or before the date on which the property is conveyed to the SCF. In turn, HHS may not be liable for any contamination that occurred after the date that the SCF controlled, occupied, and used the property.","gap":"para"}]},"pathLabel":"The legislative path","latest":{"labelText":"Signed by Pres. Trump","glyph":{"icon":"scroll","badge":true},"date":"20 October 2026"},"asOf":{"lead":"Record as of ","date":"20 October 2026","note":"the most recent action in the official record. Status can lag; each step below carries its own date."},"groups":[{"spine":{"key":"rec-H.R. 3620-24","kind":"record","spine":true,"date":"20 October 2026","labelText":"Signed by Pres. Trump","glyph":{"icon":"scroll","badge":true},"postId":"us-20261021-74fecdc8","postHref":"/p/us-20261021-74fecdc8","whatsNext":{"lead":"What's next: ","text":"Takes effect (on enactment unless the text sets other dates)"}},"isTip":true,"hidden":[],"moreLabel":"0 more actions","hideLabel":"Hide","a11yShow":"Show 0 more recorded actions","a11yHide":"Hide 0 more recorded actions"},{"spine":{"key":"rec-H.R. 3620-25","kind":"record","spine":true,"date":"20 October 2026","labelText":"Became Public Law"},"isTip":false,"hidden":[],"moreLabel":"0 more actions","hideLabel":"Hide","a11yShow":"Show 0 more recorded actions","a11yHide":"Hide 0 more recorded actions"},{"spine":{"key":"rec-H.R. 3620-23","kind":"record","spine":true,"date":"15 October 2026","labelText":"Presented to President","glyph":{"icon":"send"},"postId":"us-20261016-fe65fa65","postHref":"/p/us-20261016-fe65fa65"},"isTip":false,"hidden":[{"key":"rec-H.R. 3620-22","kind":"record","spine":false,"date":"14 October 2026","labelText":"Message on Senate action sent to the House."}],"moreLabel":"1 more action","hideLabel":"Hide","a11yShow":"Show 1 more recorded actions","a11yHide":"Hide 1 more recorded actions"},{"spine":{"key":"rec-H.R. 3620-20","kind":"record","spine":true,"date":"29 September 2026","labelText":"Passed Senate (unanimous consent)","glyph":{"icon":"capitol","badge":true},"postId":"us-20260930-61e9c830","postHref":"/p/us-20260930-61e9c830"},"isTip":false,"hidden":[],"moreLabel":"0 more actions","hideLabel":"Hide","a11yShow":"Show 0 more recorded actions","a11yHide":"Hide 0 more recorded actions"},{"spine":{"key":"rec-H.R. 3620-18","kind":"record","spine":true,"date":"3 August 2026","labelText":"Reported by committee","glyph":{"icon":"clipboard-text"},"postId":"us-20260910-0e0